a.org/w/index.php?oldid=94197344"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3726"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}}],"cities":[{"id":"city-1159149997","name":"班竹","country":"GMB","lat":13.45388,"lon":-16.5917,"kind":"city","region":"GM-B","rank":4,"capital":1,"knowledge":{"theme":"班竹 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"班珠尔位于圣玛丽岛（或班珠尔岛），冈比亚河在此汇入大西洋。\n班竹属热带草原气候，年平均气温25.5℃，年降水量1150毫米，6～10月为雨季。","culture":"1816年英国人把班珠尔建立成贸易港和秘密的奴隶交易基地。\n门高35公尺，处于广场中央，内为纺织品博物馆。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q3726","articleTitle":"班竹","sourceRevision":94197344,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 班竹","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8F%AD%E7%AB%B9"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94197344"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3726"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159141597","name":"班桑","country":"GMB","lat":13.43364,"lon":-14.65002,"kind":"city","region":"GM-M","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159141603","name":"布里卡马","country":"GMB","lat":13.28036,"lon":-16.65995,"kind":"city","region":"GM-B","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159118935","name":"詹江布尔","country":"GMB","lat":13.551,"lon":-14.767,"kind":"city","region":"GM-M","rank":10,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"詹江布尔 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"冈比亚河在詹詹布雷一带进入中游河段，冲积平原及缓坡地广布，平均海拔35公尺，河上可航行中小型船舶。\n詹詹布雷，原名乔治镇是西非国家冈比亚的城市，也是中河区的首府，市区位于该国东部冈比亚河的麦卡锡岛上，距离该国首都班珠尔283公里。","culture":"詹詹布雷始建于1832年，当时称为乔治镇，是英国殖民者为前黑奴建立的聚落，基督教卫理宗也曾在当地传教；1995年，城市由乔治镇更名为詹詹布雷。\n现今当地仍然保留了面积约为500平方公尺的历史街区，其中包括英国殖民时期的总督官邸、贸易据点、关押奴隶的屋子、基督教墓地等。","see":"该遗址现今也被冈比亚政府列入世界遗产的预备名单。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q1002786","articleTitle":"詹詹布雷","sourceRevision":92428874,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 詹詹布雷","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A9%B9%E8%A9%B9%E5%B8%83%E9%9B%B7"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92428874"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1002786"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159118951","name":"巴塞圣苏","country":"GMB","lat":13.31,"lon":-14.223,"kind":"city","region":"GM-U","rank":10,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159118969","name":"凯雷万","country":"GMB","lat":13.494,"lon":-16.095,"kind":"city","region":"GM-L","rank":10,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159118993","name":"曼薩孔科","country":"GMB","lat":13.37731,"lon":-15.67857,"kind":"city","region":"GM-L","rank":10,"capital":0}]}